{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A kit containing the Little Cow Emblem, Weapon Containers, and 7 days of Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This kit contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Cow Emblem:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emblems change the appearance of the player\u2019s profile background on the loading, in-game and post-battle stats screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Weapon Containers:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three slots with weapons, sights, and muzzle devices for a random operator. Every 10th container will give you a guaranteed primary weapon, and every fifth container \u2014 a secondary weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 days of Premium:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium speeds up in-game progress and unlocks Premium objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +20% XP if all teammates have active Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +10% XP for all teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +100% XP in all types of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +30% XP in the new Battle Pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u00a0Increases gained Karma Points by 20%.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526020?t=1746018105","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526020?t=1746018105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526020/d463b71f09e0c42a528e7295dad5aad59546dc7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746018105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526020/d463b71f09e0c42a528e7295dad5aad59546dc7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746018105","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"descr